  "notes": "Used for significant, formal acts of founding — typically organizations, institutions, or systems. Not used for casually starting small projects.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {設立|せつりつ} — establishing (focuses on the formal, legal process)\n- {創立|そうりつ} — founding (similar to {創設|そうせつ} but often used for schools and companies)\n- {創設|そうせつ} — emphasizes creating something entirely new\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {創設|そうせつ}する (to establish)\n- {創設|そうせつ}される (to be established)\n- 〜の{創設|そうせつ} (the founding of ~)",
